OL,3,GNEWSAFears as fireworks let off on main
OL,4,Aroad
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople in Hull are calling for more
OL,7,Frestrictions on the sale of fireworks
OL,8,Fafter a busy Bonfire Night and weekend
OL,9,Fin the city.
OL,11,FA video has been posted online which
OL,12,Fappears to show people near homes in
OL,13,FAnlaby Road lighting fireworks while
OL,14,Fholding them.
OL,16,FA national public consultation on
OL,17,Freforms to fireworks legislation closed
OL,18,Fin October.
